From 4521558e6e4c5f11fad4ba070deb100b84d0057d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pypto-x agent <agent@pypto-x.local>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 01:58:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 277/283] feat(execution): register the batch-1 generic opcodes
 and generic plan/execute path

- add OpContracts for where/compare/iota/exp/reduce_sum/reduce_max/cast/reshape
  with rank/broadcast/attribute/dtype/result rules, precision declarations
  (exact vs deterministic_bounded) and documented NaN/zero/inf/subnormal/
  bf16/integer-overflow/empty semantics
- add plan_operation/execute_operation over the same resolver/policy/v4
  report machinery; v3 plan schema carries the authoritative operand list,
  normalized attributes, output dtype and the resolved precision declaration
- keep the frozen matmul/qmatmul contract digests and default plan/capability/
  artifact/output digests byte-identical via an opcode-scoped portable
  capability view (same compatibility pattern as the 0047 opt-in entry)
- fail closed on unknown opcode/dtype/rank/broadcast/attribute and on
  numeric.require_proven_deviation_bound for float paths without a proven
  envelope; vendor candidates are structurally rejected
- extend doctor/explain/plan for the new opcodes and pin the behaviour in
  test_execution_ops_registry_batch1.py (125 tests) plus doc 0019

(cherry picked from commit 216b2360331d7b6ffc569c3dfac55fc0fa6214f8)
